 🗳️ Situational awareness: The Supreme Court struck down President Trump's plan to restrict mail-in ballots for midterms. Go deeper ... Read the ruling . 

 Smart Brevity™ count: 1,707 words ... 6½ mins. Thanks to Noah Bressner for orchestrating. Edited by Bill Kole. 

 
 
