 8. 🍽️ 1 for the road: America&#x27;s best tippers 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: Toast. Map: Sami Sparber/Axios Delaware, West Virginia and New Hampshire are home to America's top tippers, with diners leaving around 21% on average,  according to new Toast data shared first with Axios' Sami Sparber. 

 Why it matters: " Tip fatigue " is fueling a broader rethink of tipping culture, even as average tips haven't changed much over the past two years. 🧮 By the numbers: Nationwide, diners tipped roughly 19% on average across all restaurant types in Q2 2026.

 At the bottom: California, D.C. and Washington state, where averages run under 18%. Keep reading . 

 
 
